bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Update user verify code

control AuthService
control UserService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

AuthService -> UserService: 1. Update user verify code
activate AuthService
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 2. update user verify code
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 3. update user verify code
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 4. Return result
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 5. Update success / error
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> AuthService: 6. Result
deactivate UserService
deactivate AuthService